{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_title", "source_sha256": "24c207764a1d310aeae7c951ef3c0a44baa36cec08536b264e188ee02b2ef256", "ja": "くもり、ときどき、みんな晴れ", "zh": "阴天，偶有，大家晴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e84d5424f6c413b6228b24638ea063dc464ab57bc677d148fcd93a94360ddb09", "ja": "環と共に劇場の定期公演を見学しに来る育。\n紛失した朋花の衣装ボタンを買いにおつかい\nに出るも、帰りのバスを寝過ごしてしまう。\n失敗に落ち込む気持ちを、仲間の励ましで\n切り替え、育は自身の公演を成功させる。", "zh": "育和环一起来到剧场参观定期公演。\n她出门跑腿去买朋花弄丢的服装纽扣，\n却在回程的公交车上睡过了站。\n虽然因为失误而感到失落，但在同伴的鼓励下，\n育调整好心态，让属于自己的公演大获成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ac2aea80ed91d60aa4fef3f3e1f0157118db2cdeac03860dbaf557d462a8d4b4", "ja": "（育の新曲披露公演が、無事終わった。\n物怖じしない、堂々としたステージだったな……）", "zh": "（育的新歌演出顺利结束了。那真是一场毫不怯场、气势十足的舞台啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "8c417dd8ebbdb479aafd8fe7abd4256f166b71b9fc20e919e819ab9dd78d77c2", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！\nどうだった？　わたし、じょうずに歌えてた？", "zh": "{$P$}先生——！\n怎么样？我唱得好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5acae96e721b1fcf717e9626f24d1beaf27bb684ebcc8be6300f38c3c3f14436", "ja": "ああ。バッチリだったよ。\n今までで、一番良かったと思う！", "zh": "啊，表现得非常好。\n我觉得这是到目前为止最好的一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff8d1e74193ae7bfb38226de88531b7bfd0d60476130d9295301197200cbd85a", "ja": "本当に？　えへへっ……うれしいな♪", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿……好开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "b15d63526d92c7a187e7d81536380a9d1b41120ef919c794118c5b6c475db17a", "ja": "えっと……あのね、{$P$}さん。\n前の公演で、おつかい失敗しちゃったでしょ……？", "zh": "那个……我说啊，{$P$}先生。\n上次公演的时候，我把跑腿的事搞砸了，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f0c2bdfc6344427602b6a296fdfafd17f6ce2973d445210d5f567008f907070f", "ja": "ああ、そうだったな。", "zh": "啊，是有这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e6c1ce6442fb033b28ca5f309c21bf96befbf3fe6186808028bd3fd16136818", "ja": "でもね、わたし……いろんなこと、やってみたい！\nじょうずにできなくて、失敗しちゃうかもだけど……。", "zh": "可是，我……想尝试各种各样的事情！\n虽然可能没法做好，也可能会失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "9cb11aff9ccfec613ddc8d3a6c1dcaba74e6afe07ee7dfc53fd91c32d4acd287", "ja": "それに、今日みたいにじょうずにできたら、\nすっごくうれしいし！　えっと、だから……。", "zh": "而且，要是能像今天这样顺利做到，\n我会特别开心的！那个，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "493e900a3de6c1fe1af5efa927d7f906fb6f5419d4042b014f42c8a81bddb03b", "ja": "うん。今日できなくても、明日できるかもしれないな。\n育は毎日成長してるんだ、どんどん挑戦していこう！", "zh": "嗯。就算今天做不到，明天说不定就能做到了。\n育每天都在成长，不断去发起挑战吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "a24947e5fb3c562e5856b3bc45d7a6e0e57804f9e172d9d81fd250f94ad28801", "ja": "{$P$}さん……うん！　ありがとう！\nあっ、でも……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嗯！谢谢！\n啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "ddd0f85b847e382247d29b38e51c96a0029478ada0fc60096c69c0513a9725c2", "ja": "困ったときは、ちゃんと{$P$}さんに\n言うよ！　そのときは、わたしのそうだんに乗ってね！", "zh": "遇到困难的时候，我一定会跟{$P$}先生\n说的！到时候，你可要听我倾诉哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6272c735bd308eef55c27da92f63c89d50b959fd3a260516870b0ce31e080ea1", "ja": "ああ、わかった。約束だ！", "zh": "啊，我知道了。约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "1596ffb7c1ccac89a101ee7198c8d68ea79be39886a28764517b46b72c7d6f12", "ja": "あっ、こんなところにいたのね、育ちゃん。\n聞こえる？　みんなの声、まだ鳴り止まないの。", "zh": "啊，原来你在这里呀，育。\n听到了吗？大家的声音还没有停下来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1013_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "d575df93b43d2010df171dd17b99b09d865c657a925d695fa3875a22aae2bd6a", "ja": "うわぁ～、本当だ！", "zh": "哇～，真的耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "fb38dac8d855c4954e4fea90eddc00149600cd350a31c36175745d960bffeb8f", "ja": "うふっ、大きな声ですね～。子豚ちゃんたちが、\n育ちゃんを待っていますよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，好大的声音啊～小猪们正在等着小育呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "0909db9ad26f16347449595365f59fba9be71b2dea7923bdd6096db23344027e", "ja": "育、早く行こうよ！\nももこも、もっと歌いたいでしょ？", "zh": "育，快点走吧！桃子也还想再唱歌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "810b144e6b1db65f0ec4d75cacce0eec3110c23f64a17c262a7dca5b695aef10", "ja": "このくらい盛り上がってくれないと、張り合いが\nないよね。育は仲間だけど、ライバルだし。", "zh": "气氛不热烈到这种程度的话，就没劲了。育虽然是伙伴，但也是对手嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ec217031b2d855d129b2a7ba71d2fe177c9ec04ee51cc4554ab1de3e95c1d28b", "ja": "みんな、やる気だな？\n育、アンコール行けそうか？", "zh": "大家都干劲十足啊？\n育，能进行安可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "4808c2df9df61c78fec3cc16f3a17e1ccc00b944a0950d0f357e054190351f16", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、最後まで、みんなを盛り上げてくるね！", "zh": "没问题哦，{$P$}先生！\n我会让大家一直嗨到最后的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f29e9cd86fa4e290111c61d6f8aa86f4180ed4f56fe9a89ea573ae200d8167b", "ja": "みんな、いこう！", "zh": "大家，一起上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36", "ja": "ええ。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "83f053003249ed34a15a282b8876851cc82a60a80bb9a12e0bf33028b1d42405", "ja": "はい～♪", "zh": "好的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c76eddb5a6cdd9dcd75084c341192e26adf60407373f4604ffcaa507301dc43a", "ja": "（小さな体でできることは、今はまだ限られている。\nだからこそ、何度も挑戦するのだろう）", "zh": "（以她小小的身体，现在能做到的事情还很有限。正因为如此，她才会一次又一次地挑战吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_064_1026_p", "source_sha256": "580a05ad79098d228905d7cac16775002a22e19f45d638c2b801e4105f410f3c", "ja": "（自分の力で頑張れる事。そして、人に頼る事……\nどちらも育にとって、必要な事だからな！）", "zh": "（靠自己的力量努力，以及向别人求助……这两件事对育来说，都是不可或缺的啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
